#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:10
msgid "Customer and supplier flags"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:12
msgid "*eYssen Partner* adds two explicit checkboxes on the contact form: :guilabel:`Customer` and :guilabel:`Supplier`. They make the role of a contact a deliberate choice rather than something inferred from its documents, and they drive the :guilabel:`Customers` and :guilabel:`Suppliers` filters on the contact list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:17
