msgid "VIES re-check"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:23
msgid "Next to the VAT number, a :guilabel:`Recheck VIES` button re-validates the number against the EU VIES service on demand, and a read-only :guilabel:`Last VIES Check` field records when that last happened."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:27
msgid "The button only appears when VIES validation is enabled for the company, in :menuselection:`Settings --> Accounting --> Verify VAT Numbers`."
