#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:44
msgid ":guilabel:`Company Profile`: :guilabel:`Year of Foundation`, :guilabel:`Number of Employees` and the :guilabel:`Risk Rating`, which has four levels — :guilabel:`Minimal risk`, :guilabel:`Below average risk`, :guilabel:`Above average risk` and :guilabel:`High risk`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/contact_data.rst:47
msgid ":guilabel:`Financials`: the :guilabel:`Yearly Revenue` and the :guilabel:`Registered Capital`."
