msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Group Category` field on the contact. It is then copied onto every sales order and customer invoice of that contact, where it can be used as a filter and a grouping — and, most usefully, as a dimension in the **Sales Analysis** and **Invoice Analysis** reports."
