#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:185
msgid ":guilabel:`Product Type`: limit the rule to :guilabel:`Goods` or to :guilabel:`Service` lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:186
