msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:188
msgid ":guilabel:`Include Child Categories` (on by default): also match the sub-categories of the listed categories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:190
msgid ":guilabel:`Exclude Products`: products that never earn a commission from this rule, even if their category is listed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:194
msgid "Because the first matching rule wins, an \"everything else\" rule with an empty :guilabel:`Products` tab placed **last** in the plan works as a default rate."
