#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:102
msgid "Enter the name of the pricelist and click :guilabel:`Add a line` to create a new pricelist rule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:104
msgid "Configure the pricelist and click :guilabel:`Save & Close` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:105
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` and create a quotation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:106
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Pricelist` field, select the newly made pricelist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:107
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Update Prices` to refresh the product price and margin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:110
msgid "To apply a seasonal 5% discount on blue denim jeans that requires a minumim of two pairs of jeans in an order and is valid only from October to the end of December, the pricelist rule should look like this:"
