#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/margin.rst:133
msgid "After the changes are made, click :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Update Prices` to update the :guilabel:`Margin`, :guilabel:`Margin (%)`, and :guilabel:`Amount`. The margin is recalculated based on the pricelist-adjusted product's sales price and cost."
