#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:3
msgid "Automatic payments and dunning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:5
msgid "A contract can charge its recurring invoices automatically against a stored payment method, and retry on a fixed schedule when a charge is declined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:9
msgid "Setting up automatic charging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:11
msgid "Configure and enable a payment provider that supports saving payment methods (:doc:`../../finance/payment_providers`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:13
msgid "Let the customer save a payment method — a card or a SEPA mandate — for example from the :doc:`customer portal <portal>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:15
msgid "Open the contract and select that method in the :guilabel:`Payment Token` field. Only tokens belonging to the contract's customer are offered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:17
msgid "Set :guilabel:`Invoice Posting` to :guilabel:`Post automatically`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:19
msgid "From then on, every recurring invoice generated for that contract is posted and charged off-session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:23
msgid "A charge is only treated as successful when the payment transaction actually reports :guilabel:`Authorized` or :guilabel:`Done`. A provider that declines an off-session payment does not raise an error, so the absence of an error is never taken as a payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:28
msgid "Dunning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:30
msgid "Every charge attempt is recorded as a **dunning attempt** on the contract's :guilabel:`Dunning Attempts` tab, with its attempt number, timestamp, state, decline code and reason."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:37
msgid "Attempt state"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:38
#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/contracts.rst:68
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:39
msgid ":guilabel:`Pending`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:40
msgid "The charge is under way, or the provider has not answered yet."
