msgid "No further retry is made."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:48
msgid "The retry cadence is fixed: after the first failure the charge is retried after **1, 3, 7 and 14 days**. When those four retries are exhausted, the attempt becomes a :guilabel:`Hard Decline`."
msgstr ""

