msgid "The unit price depends on the quantity, using the brackets in the :guilabel:`Pricing Tiers` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:74
msgid ":guilabel:`Price Basis` says what the :guilabel:`Unit price` covers:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Per billing period`: the price covers one whole period, whatever its length."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`Per month`: the price is a monthly rate, and the invoice multiplies it by the number of months in the billing period. The computed :guilabel:`Period Multiplier` field shows that factor."
