msgid ":guilabel:`Graduated`: every bracket is priced separately and the results are added up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:88
msgid ":guilabel:`Volume`: one single per-unit price is used, taken from the bracket the **total** quantity falls into."
msgstr ""

