#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:126
msgid ":guilabel:`In arrears`: it is issued the day after the period ends."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoice Basis`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:130
msgid ":guilabel:`Start date`: periods run from the line's own :guilabel:`Start Date`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:131
msgid ":guilabel:`Calendar`: periods are aligned to calendar month or year boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:132
msgid ":guilabel:`Anchor Day`: periods start on a fixed day of the month, set in :guilabel:`Anchor Day`. Only days 1–28 are allowed, so that every month has one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/subscriptions/lines.rst:136
msgid "A line starting on 15 March with a monthly period bills 15 March – 14 April on the :guilabel:`Start date` basis, 1–31 March on the :guilabel:`Calendar` basis, and — with :guilabel:`Anchor Day` `1` — 1 March – 31 March."
